+
+            WebGL performs additional error checking beyond that specified in OpenGL ES 2.0 during
+            calls to <code>drawArrays</code>
+            and <code>drawElements</code>. See <a href="#ATTRIBS_AND_RANGE_CHECKING">Enabled Vertex
