+
+    <h1>WebGL Specification</h1>
+    <h2 class="no-toc">Version 1.0.3, 27 October 2014</h2>
+    <dl>
+        <dt>This version:
+            <dd>
+                <a href="https://www.khronos.org/registry/webgl/specs/1.0.3/">
