+      <dd>
+        Copy part of the data of the buffer bound to <em>readTarget</em> to the buffer bound to <em>writeTarget</em>.
+        See <a href="#COPYING_BUFFERS">Copying Buffers</a> for restrictions imposed by the WebGL 2 API.
